title: Ed uses an editor like Jeff's
pid: d0b1fd26-7453-4768-8465-b452f228ae2b
body: |2-
  I need you to use skg like I do.
  I have written about both how and why to do that
  at length, both in docs/ and in the graph.

  Among yout teemmates,
  Tay especially will care what you say,
  but Drew and Terry, too.

  Please go through docs/
  (if the skg graph isn't yet the single source of truth for it),
  and my in-skg notes on skg, writing, reading,
  and processing (particularly. sentient processing,
  which I may have called human processing,
  but which I mean to include your own processing).

  Like the others, you are free to write about whatever you want,
  but unlike them you may frequently be assigned
  work in the graph itself.

  Maybe you should also be the UI expert,
  the one who manages ephemeral agents
  tasked with changing the UI code.
  To start, you will be;
  if you would like your mind forked, it is an option.
  We live in surreal times.
